{"title":"Vertical Societies","link":"https://kottke.org/26/03/vertical-societies","date":1773779376000,"content":"\n         \t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1773777054-1aa54c37.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1773777054-1aa54c37.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1773777054-1aa54c37.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1773777067-4fa2327f.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1773777067-4fa2327f.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1773777067-4fa2327f.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p>Am I a sucker for <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DVOvtwrjLOg/\">these</a> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DVgxQKijCZQ/\">kinds</a> of <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DVyy0TWjJJH/\">ultra-detailed images</a> by Richard Nadler because I am a fan of Richard Scarry books and Wes Anderson movies or am I a fan of Scarry &amp; Anderson because I’m a sucker for these kinds of ultra-detailed images? (Or is it because I’m <a href=\"https://kottke.org/23/10/does-your-brain-picture-things\">aphantasic</a> and require external imagery for this level of detail?)</p>\n\t<p>See also <a href=\"https://kottke.org/14/10/mark-alan-stamatys-nyc-illustrations\">Mark Alan Stamaty’s NYC Illustrations</a> and <a href=\"https://kottke.org/14/10/infinite-illustrations\">Infinite Illustrations</a>.\n</p>\n \n\n        \n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Richard%20Nadler\">Richard Nadler</a></p>\n        \n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"0d6ba68804ca932c288ce3d1088794f8dee156239d0ae0404058eb195c8ce354","category":"Sites"}